    "caption": "🚀 Are you interested in scaling up your startup to the market of Europe?\n\nThen join our upcoming webinar, with Anthony Rose, CEO and Co-Founder of Seedlegals, who built and sold several startups over his career including 3D graphics, P2P music, internet video, social TV and online communities.\n\nDuring the webinar Anthony will share tips on how to:\n🔹 enter international markets in Europe and the US from legal perspective and what are the differences\n🔹 move your company and launch the business\n🔹 stand out in front of investors with help of tax exemption certificates (SEIS/EIS)\n🔹 utilize Seedlegals platform to save time and legal costs when raising your investment\n\n🌱 Seedlegals is the world’s first one-stop platform that lets founders and investors easily create, negotiate and sign all the legal agreements they need to do a funding round.\n\n⏰ 5 March, 18:00, Online.\n\n❗️ Hurry up and register for this webinar by following the link in the bio.",
